{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castleward</strong> unfolds in a dark fantasy world where you\u2019ll delve into a cursed castle crawling with <strong>corrupted beings</strong>, hidden paths, and long-buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Frida</strong>, a young witch with rare magical talents, as she battles relentless foes and unravels the mystery of a place no one enters by chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and master a vast arsenal of Spells, Ritual Artifacts, and One-of-a-Kind Weapons. Mix and match them to shape a combat style that\u2019s truly your own.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821270?t=1753121581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821270/a964eebcd88960430722c54e9025536ee038ed6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753121581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821270/3e3e9a5c43d4408e2ce4c94df93dd3ea5ca13267/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753121581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821270/3e3e9a5c43d4408e2ce4c94df93dd3ea5ca13267/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753121581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castleward</strong> unfolds in a dark fantasy world where you\u2019ll delve into a cursed castle crawling with <strong>corrupted beings</strong>, hidden paths, and long-buried secr